  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: EchoFinalCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Echo
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "Chime, I understand that you brought me here to help you,
    I just can\u2019t figure out why. Was it my time? Did you just really miss me?
    I\u2019ve gone through unexplainable things, unable to really help anyone well\u2026was
    I the right choice? I didn\u2019t even remember who you are and what you meant
    to me, I hope you don\u2019t blame me for that though. Something\u2019s happening
    to me, I hope I don\u2019t do anything too crazy\u2026"
  negativeDescription: "Chime. After being pulled in here by you, constantly feeling
    that something\u2019s off, I finally see the truth. I remember now, the tree,
    how much you used to mean to me\u2026all that, just for you to go and pull me
    into an afterlife for your own selfish reasons. You used me to get your body
    back, tricked me into touching the sacred tree. All this time you pretended to
    be my guide, to be there for me. Now, it\u2019s my time to show you my\u2026appreciation."
  positiveDescription: "Chime\u2026I want to say I\u2019m sorry for not having kinder
    words for you when I first came here...for not remembering what happened to you,
    and everything between us, but I\u2019m sure you know it wasn\u2019t my choice.
    You pulling me in here gave me this brain fog I could never shake off. Now that
    my memories are back, I can\u2019t help but feel this\u2026indescribable sorrow.
    I don\u2019t know what\u2019s about to happen, but I\u2019m sorry\u2026"
